ns and answers posted on the forum is 43200+14400 = <<43200+14400=57600>>57600\n#### 57600", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: A question and answer forum has 200 members. The average number of answers posted by each member on the forum is three times as many as the number of questions asked. If each user posts an average of 3 questions per hour, calculate the total number of questions and answers posted on the forum by its users in a day.\nSolution:", "solutions": ["57600"], "solution": "57600"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 362, 3405, 323, 4226, 11848, 702, 220, 17, 15, 15, 3613, 13, 576, 5461, 1372, 315, 11253, 8454, 553, 1817, 4462, 389, 279, 11848, 374, 2326, 3039, 438, 1657, 438, 279, 1372, 315, 4755, 4588, 13, 1416], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 752, 1430, 311, 975, 1526, 419, 3491, 3019, 553, 3019, 13, 5512, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 1281, 2704, 358, 3535, 279, 3491, 12440, 382, 4416, 11, 1052, 594, 264, 11848, 448, 220, 17, 15, 15, 3613, 13, 576, 5461, 1372, 315, 11253, 8454, 553, 1817, 4462, 374, 2326, 3039, 438, 1657, 438, 279, 1372, 315, 4755, 4588, 13, 8886]}
