here, he drives 24 miles to his grandmother’s house.  From her house, he drives 27 miles straight to his apartment.  How many additional miles did Kona drive round trip to the bakery stop, compared to a round trip without the bakery stop?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["6"], "solution": "6"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 5542, 806, 13154, 11, 730, 6721, 20118, 220, 24, 8756, 311, 279, 65144, 13, 220, 5542, 1052, 11, 566, 20118, 220, 17, 19, 8756, 311, 806, 38184, 748, 3753, 13, 220, 5542, 1059, 3753, 11, 566, 20118], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 773, 730, 6721, 20118, 504, 806, 13154, 311, 279, 65144, 11, 1221, 504, 1052, 311, 806, 38184, 748, 3753, 11, 323, 1221, 504, 82677, 748, 3753, 1182, 311, 806, 13154, 13, 576, 3405, 374, 10161, 1246, 1657, 5107, 8756, 566, 23108, 304, 279, 4778, 8411, 311, 279, 65144, 7707, 311, 279, 4778, 8411, 2041, 279, 65144, 13, 88190, 382, 5338]}
